  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNAIDS RST/ESA Accelerated Combination Prevention for Results in Eastern and Southern Africa 2011-13</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNAIDS-RST/ESA Accelerated Combination Prevention for Results in Eastern and Southern Africa 2011-13</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programmet f&#xf6;ljer UNAIDS strategi &quot;Getting to Zero&quot; 2011-2015, med syfte att halvera sexuell &#xf6;verf&#xf6;ring av hiv, eliminera mor-till-barn&#xf6;verf&#xf6;ring samt halvering av aids-relaterad  m&#xf6;drad&#xf6;dlighet till &#xe5;r 2015. F&#xf6;r att uppn&#xe5; syftet bidrar UNIADS bland annat med regionala situationsanalyser och st&#xe4;rkande av teknisk kapacitet p&#xe5; landkontor och samarbetspartners.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme is guided by UNAIDS 2011 - 2015 strategy &apos;Getting to Zero&apos;, UNAIDS outcome framework and the Unified Budget and  Work-Plan. In terms of the strategy it relates to the goals on halving sexual transmission of HIV, eliminating vertical transmission and halving AIDS related maternal mortality by 2015. The programme provides regional analysis and technical support.</narrative>
  </description>
